  ==> [[1., 4., -9.],
       [2., 1., 4.],
       [3., 2., 1.]]

  operator.shape
  ==> [3, 3]

  operator.log_abs_determinant()
  ==> scalar Tensor

  x = ... Shape [3, 4] Tensor
  operator.matmul(x)
  ==> Shape [3, 4] Tensor
  ```

